# The shared library behind the `log`, `show` and `diff` tools: std/bash with
# `lib.sh` bound as an arg, which each of those entries curries its own command
# body onto.
#
# It is an ENTRY rather than a file each tool copies because there is one
# library and three callers. A tool's worker sources it from /cas/args/lib.
curry --base:@=DEEP-DEPS/bash --lib:@=lib.sh
